## Categories
antag-category-ccnt-name = Central Command/NanoTrasen
antag-category-ccnt-desc = A strange duopoly of power between a corporate hegemon and the declawed firm that won them their hegemony, CC-NT represents the bosses of the station's bosses, and their bosses above.


## Roles- CCNT
roles-antag-name-centcommop = Central Command Operator
roles-antag-centcommop-objective = You are the highest authority over the station in lieu of direct NanoTrasen intervention. Oversee the day-to-day operations of the station, and keep your contractors in line.

roles-antag-name-gso = Greenshield Officer
roles-antag-gso-objective = You are an elite bodyguard for some of the most powerful people in the sector. Ensure that they survive at all costs.

roles-antag-name-ert-leader = ERT Leader
roles-antag-ert-leader-objective = You are a senior member of the Emergency Response Force, and will lead an Emergency Response Team to relieve a civilian station of their woes.

roles-antag-name-ert-spec = ERT Specialist
roles-antag-ert-spec-objective = You are a specialist for the Emergency Response Force. Follow your leader, and work with station crew to put an end to the emergency you've been mobilised against.

roles-antag-name-cburn = CBURN Corpsman
roles-antag-cburn-objective = You are a member of the CBURN corps, specialists in chemical, biological, unidentified, radiological, and nuclear threat mitigation.

roles-antag-name-cburn-liquidator = CBURN Liquidator
roles-antag-cburn-liquidator-objective = You are the pride and joy of Central Command. Be the tip of the spear for the most hostile of infestations, the most brutal of disasters, and pierce through to the light beyond.

roles-antag-name-ntnc-marine = NanoTrasen Naval Corps Marine
roles-antag-ntnc-marine-objective = You are an elite marine for the NanoTrasen Asset Protection Division, referred to internally as the Naval Corps. Follow your officers, and carry out your duty.

roles-antag-name-ntnc-medic = NanoTrasen Naval Corps Marine Medic
roles-antag-ntnc-medic-objective = You are a combat medic for the NanoTrasen Asset Protection Division, referred to internally as the Naval Corps. Follow your officers, and keep your fellow marines in good condition.

roles-antag-name-ntnc-leader = NanoTrasen Naval Corps Officer
roles-antag-ntnc-leader-objective = You are a commissioned officer for the NTAPD. Carry out the will of NanoTrasen in the sector, and ensure that the Naval Corps remains a respected symbol of corporate power.

roles-antag-name-ntsf = NanoTrasen Special Forces Agent
roles-antag-ntsf-objective = You are the best of the best, and the ultimate symbol of NanoTrasen's power. Carry out your corporation's will with extreme prejudice.

